* DONE [#A] <<4.3>> Stale copies in =/bisos/asc/web/bin/= shadow the package on PATH :aiAndMe:
CLOSED: [2026-10-01 Thu]
SCHEDULED: <2026-10-01 Thu>
:PROPERTIES:
:ARCHIVE_TIME: 2026-10-01 Thu 22:21
:ARCHIVE_FILE: /bxRepos/bisos-pip/airflow/AI-WorkPlan.org
:ARCHIVE_OLPATH: Stage 4 TODOs
:ARCHIVE_CATEGORY: AI-WorkPlan
